[6147]={11878,0,0,0,"Return to Nathanos Blightcaller with the new information."},
[6148]={11878,{12339},0,0,"The Scarlet Crusade is on the move. Somewhere along the road from Tyr's Hand to Stratholme you will find the Oracle, Demetria, and her entourage. Hunt her down and slay her. Return to Nathanos Blightcaller should you succeed."},
