[6187]={1748,{11878},0,0,"Assemble an army and travel to the Eastern Plaguelands. Launch a full assault on Nathanos Blightcaller and any Horde filth that may attempt to protect him.  Keep your wits about you, $N. The Horde will defend the ranger lord with their very lives."},
