[6622]={12920,0,0,0,"Save patients by using Triage Bandages to tend to their wounds. You must save 15 patients before 6 of them die from their injuries.  Remember the order of triage! Critically Injured Soldiers die the fastest followed by Badly Injured Soldiers. Injured Soldiers take the longest to die and should be saved AFTER your Critically Injured and Badly Injured Soldiers have been triaged."},
[6623]={12920,0,0,0,"Travel to Hammerfall in the Arathi Highlands and speak with Doctor Gregory Victor about joining the ranks of Horde Trauma."},
[6624]={12939,0,0,0,"Save patients by using Triage Bandages to tend to their wounds. You must save 15 patients before 6 of them die from their injuries.  Remember the order of triage! Critically Injured Soldiers die the fastest followed by Badly Injured Soldiers. Injured Soldiers take the longest to die and should be saved AFTER your Critically Injured and Badly Injured Soldiers have been triaged."},
[6625]={12939,0,0,0,"Travel to Theramore in the Dustwallow Marsh and speak with Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen about joining the ranks of Alliance Trauma."},
