[7541]={4047,0,0,0,""},
[7622]={14494,0,0,0,"Save 50 Peasants before 15 are slain. Speak with Eris Havenfire should you accomplish this task.  You may view the Death Post to view how many Peasants have been slain."},
[7632]={14524,0,0,0,"Find the owner of the Ancient Petrified Leaf. Good luck, $N; It's a big world."},
[7634]={14526,0,0,{18704},"Hastat the Ancient has asked that you bring him a Mature Blue Dragon Sinew. Should you find this sinew, return it to Hastat in Felwood."},
[7635]={14525,0,0,{18705},"Stoma the Ancient has asked that you bring him a Mature Black Dragon Sinew. Should you find this sinew, return it to Stoma in Felwood."},
[7636]={14524,0,0,{18952,18953,18954,18955},"You must find and destroy these four demonic corrupters:  Simone the Seductress.  Klinfran the Crazed.  Solenor the Slayer.  Artorius the Doombringer.  Destroy these creatures and return to Vartrus the Ancient in Felwood with their heads.  Refer to the Petrified Bark in your inventory for clues as to their whereabouts.  You MUST complete this task by yourself."},
[7649]={14368,0,0,0,"Return the book to its rightful owners."},
[7650]={14368,0,0,0,"Return the book to its rightful owners."},
[7667]={13417,0,0,{12800,18335},"If you are interested in helping Sagorne Crestrider in Orgrimmar's Valley of Wisdom, bring him an Azerothian Diamond and a Pristine Black Diamond."},
[7668]={0,0,0,{18880},"Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance. Doing so will bring forth spirits you must fight. Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver; defeat him.  Bring Darkreaver's Head to Sagorne Creststrider in the Valley of Wisdom, Orgrimmar."},
[7701]={14634,0,0,{18946},"Deep within the Slag Pit of the Cauldron, in the Searing Gorge, you will find the traitorous Dark Iron dwarf named Overseer Maltorius.  Slay Overseer Maltorius and take his head. Return the head to Lookout Captain Lolo Longstriker in the Searing Gorge for your reward."},
[7703]={14325,0,0,{18336},"Find the Gauntlet of Gordok Might and return it to Captain Kromcrush in Dire Maul.  According to Kromcrush, the \"old timey story\" says that Tortheldrin - a \"creepy\" elf who called himself a prince - stole it from one of the Gordok kings."},
[7721]={14637,0,0,{18958},"Collect 10 Water Elemental Cores from the Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays along the Forgotten Coast of Feralas, and bring them back to Zorbin Fandazzle who is near the dock there."},
[7722]={14624,0,0,{18922},"Somewhere in the Slag Pit of the Cauldron you will find the Secret Plans: Fiery Flux that Overseer Maltorius stole. Find those plans and return them to Master Smith Burninate in the Searing Gorge."},
[7723]={14627,{5854},0,0,"Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Heavy War Golems.  The Heavy War Golems wander the areas surrounding the Cauldron in the Searing Gorge. When you've killed enough, return to Hansel in Searing Gorge."},
[7724]={14627,{5858},0,0,"Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Greater Lava Spiders in the Searing Gorge. You can find Greater Lava Spiders in the plateaus and lava pools of the Searing Gorge.  Return to Hansel Heavyhands in the Searing Gorge when you have killed enough Greater Lava Spiders."},
[7727]={14627,{9318},0,0,"Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Incendosaurs.  You will find Incendosaurs occupying the lava pools inside the Slag Pit. The Slag Pit can be found in the Cauldron of the Searing Gorge.  Return to Hansel Heavyhands in the Searing Gorge when you have killed enough Incendosaurs."},
[7728]={14626,0,0,{18959,18960},"Find and return the Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass to Taskmaster Scrange in the Searing Gorge.  The only information you have about these items is the following: They were definitely stolen by Dark Iron dwarves. The Smithing Tuyere is a blacksmithing tool used by blacksmiths and the Lookout's Spyglass is an invaluable monitoring tool to lookouts."},
[7729]={14626,{5846,5844},0,0,"Slay 15 Dark Iron Taskmasters and 15 Dark Iron Slavers. Return to Taskmaster Scrange in the Searing Gorge once you have accomplished this task."},
[7730]={7875,0,0,{18961},"Bring 20 Zukk'ash Carapaces to Hadoken Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas."},
[7731]={7875,0,0,{18962},"Defeat Stinglasher in the Writhing Deep, bringing its glands back to Hadoken Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas."},
[7732]={7010,0,0,0,"Deliver the Camp Mojache Zukk'ash Report to Zilzibin Drumlore. He resides in the Drag of Orgrimmar."},
[7733]={7852,0,0,{18947},"Bring 10 Rage Scar Yeti Hides to Pratt McGrubben at Feathermoon Stronghold, Feralas."},
[7734]={7854,0,0,{18947},"Bring 10 Rage Scar Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas."},
[7761]={-179880,0,0,0,"That is one stupid orc. It would appear as if you need to find this brand and gain the Mark of Drakkisath in order to access the Orb of Command.  The letter indicates that General Drakkisath guards the brand. Perhaps you should investigate."},
[7781]={1748,0,0,0,"Return the Head of Nefarian to Highlord Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind."},
[7782]={14721,0,0,0,"Venture to the Valley of Heroes in Stormwind City and speak with Field Marshal Afrasiabi."},
[7783]={4949,0,0,0,"Return the Head of Nefarian to Thrall in Orgrimmar."},
[7784]={14720,0,0,0,"Speak with High Overlord Saurfang in Orgrimmar. He stands waiting for you in the Valley of Strength."},
[7810]={14508,0,0,0,"Speak with Short John Mithril in the Stranglethorn Arena."},
[7815]={14740,{2505},0,0,"Katoom the Angler at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 15 Saltwater Snapjaw turtles. Return to him when you have completed this task."},
[7816]={14740,0,0,{19023},"Katoom the Angler at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill Gammerita and retrieve Katoom's Best Lure from her corpse.  Katoom mentioned that Gammerita hangs out on the coast with the other turtles."},
[7828]={14741,{2926,2925},0,0,"Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 10 Silvermane Stalkers and 10 Silvermane Howlers. Return to him once the task is complete.  Markhor mentioned that the wolves hide in the wilds of the Hinterlands."},
[7829]={14741,{2929},0,0,"Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 20 Savage Owlbeasts. Return to him once the task is complete.  Markhor mentioned that the Savage Owlbeasts occupy the wilds of the Hinterlands."},
[7830]={14741,0,0,{19025},"Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill a Razorbeak Skylord and retrieve its Skylord Plume. Return to him once the task is complete.  Markhor mentioned that the Razorbeak Skylord are a rare breed that tend to occupy the wilds of the Hinterlands."},
[7839]={14737,0,0,{19033},"Smith Slagtree at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to find Slagtree's Lost Tools. Return to him once this task is complete.  You recall Smith Slagtree mentioning that the tools might be at one of the Vilebranch temples in the northeastern region of the Hinterlands. You should also check Skulk Rock."},
[7840]={14731,0,0,{19034},"Lard at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to find Lard's Lunch. Return to him when this task is complete.  Lard mentioned that he left it on the island to the north. Watch out for Vilebranch trolls."},
[7841]={14738,{2692,2691,2694,2693},0,0,"Otho Moji'ko at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to slaughter 15 Highvale Outrunners, 15 Highvale Scouts, 15 Highvale Marksman and 15 Highvale Rangers. Return to him when this task is complete.  You can find the Highvale high elves at the Quel'Danil Lodge in the northwestern region of the Hinterlands."},
[7842]={14738,0,0,{4589},"Otho Moji'ko at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to bring him 10 Long Elegant Feathers from the gryphons that inhabit the Hinterlands. Return to him once this task is complete.  Gryphons are known to inhabit every region of the Hinterlands."},
[7843]={14738,0,0,0,"Otho Moji'ko at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to travel to Aerie Peak in the western region of the Hinterlands and place the Final Message to the Wildhammer by the well in the center of town. Return to him once this task is complete.  Beware of angry Wildhammer dwarves and unruly members of the Alliance."},
[7844]={14739,{4466,4467},0,0,"Mystic Yayo'jin at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 15 Vilebranch Scalpers and 10 Vilebranch Soothsayers. Return to her when this task is complete.  Yayo'jin indicated that these trolls could be found near the Shaol'watha and Agol'watha temples in the north by northeastern region of the Hinterlands."},
[7845]={14757,0,0,0,"Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to rescue her mate, Elder Torntusk, from Jintha'alor.  You have been told that he is being held prisoner atop Jintha'alor, the Vilebranch capital city located in the southern region of the Hinterlands."},
[7846]={14757,0,0,{19064},"Elder Torntusk at Jintha'alor wants you to kill Hitah'ya the Keeper to get the Shackle Key to his bindings. Return to Elder Torntusk when you have recovered the key."},
[7847]={14736,0,0,0,"Elder Torntusk at Jintha'alor wants you to return to Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village with news of his rescue."},
[7848]={14387,0,0,{18412},"Venture to the Molten Core entry portal in Blackrock Depths and recover a Core Fragment. Return to Lothos Riftwaker in Blackrock Mountain when you have recovered the Core Fragment."},
[7849]={14741,0,0,{19069,19070},"Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to recover his twin brother's remains. Find and return Huntsman Malkhor's Skull and Huntsman Malkhor's Bones to Huntsman Markhor.  Markhor mentioned that his brother's remains were fed to the oozes and wolves of the Vilebranch. He also mentioned that there is a refuse pit filled with oozes in Jintha'alor as well as a wolf den. Both of these places are near the top of the temple."},
[7850]={14736,0,0,{19071},"Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to recover 10 Vessels of Tainted Blood from Jintha'alor. Return to Primal Torntusk when this task is complete."},
[7861]={14736,{7995,2648},0,0,"You have been ordered to slay Vile Priestess Hexx and 10 Vilebranch Aman'zasi Guards. See Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands once this task is complete.  Vile Priestess Hexx and the Aman'zasi Guards can be found atop Jintha'alor in the Hinterlands."},
[7862]={14736,{2643,2645,2646,2647},0,0,"You have been tasked with the decimation of 10 Vilebranch Berserkers, 5 Vilebranch Shadow Hunters, 5 Vilebranch Blood Drinkers, and 5 Vilebranch Soul Eaters.  Should you complete this task, return to Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands."},
