[10193]={19468,{18857,18852,19779},0,0,"Spymaster Thalodien at Area 52 wants you to go to Manaforge B'naar and slay 2 Sunfury Warp-Masters, 6 Sunfury Warp-Engineers and 8 Sunfury Geologists.  Completing quests for the Scryers will cause your Aldor reputation level to decrease."},
